WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.630
Inherited will...

3
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.540
the tides of time,
and humanity's dreams...

4
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.370
They cannot be stopped.

5
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.480
As long as people seek freedom,

6
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.110
these things will never cease to be.

7
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:55.220
<b>It Begins</b>

8
00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:58.700
Crocodile!

9
00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.750
Get out here!

10
00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:14.430
I came all this way to kick your ass!

11
00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:19.660
Crocod–

12
00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.900
That's gonna have
 the opposite effect!

13
00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.110
He's considered the country's hero!

14
00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:28.490
You wanna upset the patrons too?!

15
00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:30.290
O-Okay! What do we do, then?!

16
00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:34.560
J-Just slow down and wait for Vivi! 
We need her to point out Crocodile!

17
00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:36.880
Speaking of Vivi, where is she?

18
00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:44.140
Vivi! Crocodile! Where are you?!

19
00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.140
Hey!

20
00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:49.710
Assistant Manager! A bunch 
of weirdos just came inside!

21
00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:53.030
Have security take care of 'em. 
Don't cause a scene!

22
00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:58.740
Hey! Vivi and Crocodile 
aren't coming!

23
00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.220
I've got you now, Straw Hat!

24
00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:03.160
Smoker!

25
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.040
Just scurryin' around everywhere!

26
00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.670
It's Smokey!

27
00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.990
R-Run!

28
00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:15.010
Damn! What's that smoke 
freak doing here in Rainbase?!

29
00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.470
Maybe he's got a thing for Luffy!

30
00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.100
This building's surrounded by water! 
Dead end!

31
00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.390
Please stop, sir!

32
00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.890
Government officials 
aren't allowed inside!

33
00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.320
Move!

34
00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.110
He's so stubborn!

35
00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:31.690
Get back here!

36
00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:35.450
I can't deal with that guy!

37
00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.990
Just a minute, sir.

38
00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.740
I must ask that you leave–

39
00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.040
Wh-What the...?!

40
00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:47.420
Huh? Did I just run into something?

41
00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:55.610
Manager! This is terrible! 
A strange group of people have...

42
00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:58.180
Send them to the VIP room.

43
00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:01.680
Orders from the owner 
Crocodile himself.

44
00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.310
Stop!

45
00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.440
Hey! Look there!

46
00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.890
Thank you...

47
00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.650
for coming!

48
00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.390
Right this way!

49
00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.320
This is the VIP room!

50
00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.240
VIP room?!

51
00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:18.950
He may as well be saying, 
"Bring it on," right?!

52
00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:22.240
This guy gets right to the point!

53
00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.830
All right! Let's go!

54
00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:29.580
VIP?! Does their connection 
to Crocodile run that deep?!

55
00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:34.250
Depending on what this uncovers, 
I could send 'em all to the gallows!

56
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.840
But what's a VIP?!

57
00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.690
Hey! The path splits!

58
00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.320
VIPs... go to the left!

59
00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.900
And it says pirates go this way!

60
00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.010
Which way do we go?!

61
00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.430
Hurry and decide!

62
00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:48.430
VIPs, obviously! VIPs!

63
00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:52.980
But we're pirates! 
Pirates go this way!

64
00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:51.480
<b>V.I.P Pirate</b>

65
00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:53.360
<b>V.I.P Pirate</b>

66
00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:55.110
Yeah! You got a point there!

67
00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:55.110
<b>V.I.P Pirate</b>

68
00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:57.940
W-Wait!

69
00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.030
Straw Hat!

70
00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.450
Huh?!

71
00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:04.450
What the hell is this?!

72
00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.910
I can't believe we fell for this trick.

73
00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.430
It's my compelled-to-swim-when-
falling-in-darkness disease!

74
00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:14.740
A trapdoor!

75
00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.760
A clever trap.

76
00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:23.050
Yeah. It got us good.

77
00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.030
More like easily avoidable!

78
00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:26.760
We played right into their hands!

79
00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.520
You're the poster children for stupid!

80
00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:32.310
Anyway... suddenly... 
I feel so weak.

81
00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.310
Why's that? You getting hungry?

82
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:36.570
Luffy!

83
00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:40.950
Luffy!

84
00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:48.080
I-I-I'll fight you 
if you want, smoke freak!

85
00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.320
I once helped take down 
a bomb man!

86
00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.710
Achoo...

87
00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:58.550
Huh? I have no strength... 
Just like when I fall in water.

88
00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:01.130
What have you done to Luffy?!

89
00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:06.320
At the tip of this jutte is 
a material called seastone.

90
00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:09.600
The going rumor is this strange stone 
is found in just one sea.

91
00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:12.530
Not much is known about it,

92
00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:16.010
but it basically gives off 
the same energy as the ocean.

93
00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:18.950
You can think of it 
as the sea in solid form.

94
00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:21.400
So it makes Luffy weak?

95
00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:25.920
Every jail cell at Navy Headquarters 
is constructed with this stuff

96
00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:29.990
to keep criminals with 
devil fruit powers from escaping.

97
00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:33.160
You're saying... 
this prison cell is the same?

98
00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.580
If it weren't, 
I'd be long gone by now.

99
00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:41.420
And you... I'd make it so you never take to sea again!

100
00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:51.140
Wait! Wait! You're not actually 
thinking of fighting in here, are you?!

101
00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.810
Not to mention, he becomes smoke! 
Swords are useless against him!

102
00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:58.770
That's correct. Give it up.

103
00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.740
You're going to die together...

104
00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:09.070
so why not try and get along?

105
00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.370
Crocodile!

106
00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:15.920
What?!

107
00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.560
So he's one of the Seven Warlords?

108
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.860
Looks as despicable as I thought.

109
00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:47.450
Oho! You live up to your reputation 
as a "wild dog," Smoker-kun.

110
00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:51.490
It seems you never truly believed 
I was on your side.

111
00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:54.790
And indeed, 
you would be correct.

112
00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:59.200
Smoker. I think I'll have you die 
an "accidental" death.

113
00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:02.830
I'll inform the government 
that you fought well

114
00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.860
against the ragtag Straw Hat Pirates.

115
00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:09.650
I don't know why you've come 
to this country,

116
00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.800
but I assume you're on your own.

117
00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.790
The government would 
never have sent you here

118
00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.770
because we warlords 
of the sea are trusted.

119
00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:21.480
So you're that Crocodile guy?!

120
00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.150
Hey! You! Fight me–

121
00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.240
Pay attention! Don't touch the bars!

122
00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:33.550
Straw Hat Luffy. 
You've done well to come this far.

123
00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:36.250
I promise to get rid of you, 
all in due time.

124
00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.210
Now we just need the guest of honor.

125
00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.500
Guest of honor?

126
00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:44.190
I just sent my partner to pick her up.

127
00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:59.370
I can't afford to waste time 
in a place like this!

128
00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:09.530
You've put up quite 
the fight, Princess.

129
00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:17.500
I'd expect no less 
from a former frontier agent!

130
00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:21.770
But don't you think it's 
time you accepted your fate?

131
00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:26.420
I have to hurry to the others!

132
00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:32.380
Now come! The boss is waiting!

133
00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:36.720
Don't touch me!

134
00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.560
Wh-What the...?! Is that a bird?!

135
00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.070
A falcon?!

136
00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:53.740
But why does a bird 
have machine guns?!

137
00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.400
It's huge!

138
00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.290
Shoot it down!

139
00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.760
Crap! The princess!

140
00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:14.180
Pell! You came for me!

141
00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.430
It is a joy to see you again, 
Your Highness.

142
00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.480
Please remain here a moment.

143
00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.300
Pell?!

144
00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:25.440
Not Pell the Falcon?!

145
00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:29.570
H-He's Arabasta's mightiest warrior!

146
00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:33.650
Bird-Bird Fruit: Falcon!

147
00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:36.730
There are only five types 
known to grant flight,

148
00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:39.910
so savor this rare privilege!

149
00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.710
S-Shoot! Shoot like crazy!

150
00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:44.750
He vanished!

151
00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:49.950
Flying Talons!

152
00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:01.200
You are a lifesaver! 
Now, I must hurry to the others!

153
00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:04.730
Really? Aren't you 
getting ahead of yourself?

154
00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.560
You've been a real thorn in our side.

155
00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.070
Miss All-Sunday!

156
00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:15.530
It seems our precious employees 
have been decommissioned.

157
00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.710
Vice President...

158
00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:20.160
Who are you?!

159
00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:25.460
That was magnificent. 
I've never seen someone who can fly.

160
00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.670
But, are you stronger than me?

161
00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:34.170
Princess Vivi, I take it these are 
the ones threatening our homeland?

162
00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:41.100
I'd like to invite the princess 
to our mansion. What do you say?

163
00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:45.020
How absurd! 
This is out of the question!

164
00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:46.810
Oh.

165
00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:49.860
Don't screw with us!

166
00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:56.780
Such language from a princess 
is so unexpected, Miss Wednesday.

167
00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:03.830
After what you did to Igaram...

168
00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:07.580
Igaram? Oh, Mr. 8?

169
00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:10.880
Don't tell me you killed Igaram-san ?!

170
00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:13.310
What are you getting 
so worked up for?

171
00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:17.380
How was that any different 
from what you did to our employees?

172
00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.390
Don't be so petulant.

173
00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:26.100
Damn you!

174
00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.560
I will add you to Arabasta's 
wealth of sand!

175
00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:35.760
Tres Fleur.

176
00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.500
Pell!

177
00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:51.630
Your Highness! You are unhurt!

178
00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:55.800
Did you think I had killed this girl?

179
00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.670
D-Damn you! What did you do?!

180
00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:02.760
Don't be so angry. 
I'm just having a bit of fun with you.

181
00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:06.060
You have devil fruit powers?!

182
00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:10.290
That's right. I partook 
of the Flower-Flower Fruit.

183
00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.480
I can make any part of my body 
bloom like flowers.

184
00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.020
This is my ability.

185
00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:21.950
My limbs can sprout from anywhere. 
You can't escape my reach.

186
00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:25.000
Escape?! Nonsense!

187
00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.950
I will avenge Igaram-san 
right here, right now!

188
00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:33.200
So sorry. While I was indeed 
enjoying this, playtime is over.

189
00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.880
That's all right! This won't take long!

190
00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:39.090
It seems you still don't understand.

191
00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.920
Seis Fleur!

192
00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.720
A submission hold?!

193
00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:52.350
Power. Speed. 
These mean nothing to me.

194
00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:55.440
Clutch!

195
00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.560
Pell!

196
00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:10.040
He was the kingdom's 
mightiest warrior?

197
00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:12.460
N-No...

198
00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:15.040
Now, off we go.

199
00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:17.500
I'm not seeing this...

200
00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:21.470
Our boss and your 
friends are waiting.

201
00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:27.960
Inside a prison cell 
deep within Rain Dinners.

202
00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.190
Look at me, I'm Sanji.

203
00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:36.800
You the one who ate the meat?

204
00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.490
Act like...

205
00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.470
Collier!

206
00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.150
Here's Zoro! "Oni!"

207
00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:43.480
serious prisoners!

208
00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:48.750
How can you act like that 
when we're in a serious bind?!

209
00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:51.920
We can't get out, 
so what else is there to do?!

210
00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.580
The fact we can't get out 
is what makes it serious!

211
00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.320
We might wind up dead 
if we don't do something!

212
00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:00.090
And why are you sleeping?!

213
00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:01.790
Oh, is it morning?

214
00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.590
It's noon!

215
00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:08.140
You're a high-spirited girl.

216
00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:12.700
Whatever! Go ahead 
and act confident while you still can!

217
00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.870
Once these guys get out of here,

218
00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:18.210
they'll kick your butt and send you 
flying above the clouds!

219
00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:20.210
Isn't that right, Luffy?!

220
00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:22.650
Of course it is, you jerk!

221
00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.620
As a captain, you certainly instill 
a lot of trust, Straw Hat Luffy.

222
00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.330
Trust...

223
00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.580
The most unneeded 
thing in this world.

224
00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.530
Where does he get off, 
insulting us like that?!

225
00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:40.040
Q-Quiet! You're gonna 
upset him, too!

226
00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.500
Crocodile!

227
00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:47.470
Vivi!

228
00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:54.730
Welcome, Vivi, princess of Arabasta! 
No, Miss Wednesday!

229
00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:58.900
I'm impressed you managed to evade 
our assassins to come this far!

230
00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:05.920
I would go as far as it takes... 
to see you meet your demise, Mr. 0!

231
00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:08.860
If only you hadn't come 
to this country...

232
00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.490
Wait! Vivi! Let us out!

233
00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:15.000
Arabasta would've remained peaceful!

234
00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:20.580
Peacock String Slasher!

235
00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:25.840
It's no use.

236
00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:31.010
Satisfied?

237
00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:35.000
As a citizen of this country, 
you must know

238
00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:38.190
that I have the power 
of the Sand-Sand Fruit.

239
00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:45.440
Want to become a mummy?

240
00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.400
A s-sand person!

241
00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.910
Hey, you! Get away from Vivi! 
I'll kick your ass!

242
00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.370
Sit.

243
00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:59.280
Perfect timing. 
The party is just starting.

244
00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.300
Isn't that right, Miss All-Sunday?

245
00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:02.130
Right.

246
00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:04.590
Party?

247
00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:09.590
It just turned noon. 
Operation Utopia is now underway.

248
00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:11.790
Operation Utopia?

249
00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:14.050
What's an "Operation Utopia"?

250
00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:20.610
Hey!

251
00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:33.450
It will be this pathetic little kingdom 
that dies, Miss Wednesday.

252
00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:43.040
I'm going to wipe Arabasta 
from the face of the earth!

253
00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.710
All people, big and small, 
will be sucked into eternal darkness

254
00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.970
as they writhe in pain.

255
00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:57.010
Let Operation Utopia...

256
00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.380
